<% content_for :meta_title, "Sunchef | About" %>

<div id="about">
  <section class="intro intro-about">
    <div class="d-flex container flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center align-items-md-end justify-content-center justify-content-md-between h-100">
      <div class="title-wrapper">
        <h1 class="mb-0">Hello</h1>
        <h1 class="mb-0">Sunshine</h1>
      </div>
      <%= image_tag 'illustration-about.svg', class: "woman" %>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section>
    <div class="row m-0 h-100">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 m-0 p-0 order-2 order-md-1">
        <div class="flower-container position-relative d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">
          <%= image_tag "blobs.svg", alt: "blobs", class: "blobs-image position-absolute" %>
          <%= image_tag "flower.png", alt: "flower", class: "flower-img" %>
          <%= image_tag "blobs-about.svg", alt: "blobs", class: "blobs-about position-absolute" %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 m-0 p-0 order-1 order-md-2">
        <div class="about-container position-relative d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
          <div class="py-4 py-md-0 px-4 founder-of-sunchef z-index-above">
            <h5 class="mb-0">I'm Soraya, founder of Sunchef</h5>
            <h5 class="bottom">and a certified holistic health coach.</h5>
            <p class="paragraph">I'm here to help you understand how to find your balance. There is no one size fits all formula - your journey is unique to you. It is always crucial, however, to understand our own agency - our health is a vehicle and we are able to navigate it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="founder-of-sunchef py-4 py-md-5 px-4 about-description-section">
    <h5 class="bottom">It started with a growing curiosity..</h5>
    <p>My journey of enlightenment towards holistic health began when I became curious about how the food I ate made me feel, and how it affected my body. Once this seed was planted and I started to understand the relationship between what I eat and my overall wellbeing, I became hungry for more information. This is where my education in holistic health through Integrative
Nutrition began.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">What stuck with me most is the fact that it all starts with what goes into your body. In other words - food.
How you eat is essential to creating balance in your life - it has the ability to nurture or hinder your experience. </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section--green m-0 py-5">
    <div class="container d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-around py-5">
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center me-md-4 item">
        <%= image_tag "pepper-yellow.svg", alt: "yellow pepper", class: "yellow-pepper" %>
      </div>
      <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 item">
        <div>
          <p class="green-quote">-</p>
          <p class="green-quote small-line-height">Health and happiness are always just around the corner.</p>
          <p class="small-green-quote">Only if you're ready :)</p>
          <p class="mission">Sunchef's mission is to help you <span class="mission-green">become an expert on you!</span> Together, we can design a personalised path towards the best version of yourself, and inspire you to find pleasure in cooking. Remember: healthy food doesn't have to compromise on taste!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="soraya-section container d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center justify-content-around">
    <div class="d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">
      <%= image_tag "soraya.png", alt: "Soraya", class: "soraya-image" %>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="heading">Walk the Talk</h2>
      <p class="paragraph">“I consider myself to be my first client. It is important to honor my journey and continually evolve as a person in order to guide and help you to the best of my abilities.”</p>
      <p class="sunchef-signature">-SORAYA AKA SUNCHEF</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="block-yellow"></div>
</div>
